use firn/tags

ripgrep is a Module
ripgrep is tagged development
ripgrep is tagged doom-emacs

nix module
  arguments: config, lib, pkgs, ...
  config when config.myConfig.modules.ripgrep.enable
    "environment"
      "systemPackages": [pkgs.ripgrep]
  option "myConfig"."modules"."ripgrep"."enable": enable "ripgrep search tool"
